# 317 - rmail Account Creation System

Two-pathway account system: permanent guest accounts with public credentials,
and ephemeral rmail accounts tied to message lifecycle.

## Current Behavior

- Accounts are created manually via worldserver console or SQL
- No guest accounts with public credentials exist
- No integration between rmail and game server
- Account deletion requires manual intervention

## Intended Behavior

### Pathway 1: Guest Accounts (Permanent)

Public accounts with shared credentials that anyone can use. These are never
deleted by the system.

