## Notes

The two-pathway system provides:

- **Guest accounts**: Zero-friction onboarding. Anyone can play immediately
  with public credentials. Shared character slots encourage social play.

- **rmail accounts**: Private accounts for committed players. The bi-directional
  deletion creates an elegant lifecycle - the account exists exactly as long as
  the message exists. Users control their own data.

The protected list ensures guest accounts are never accidentally deleted by the
rmail hook, maintaining the public access guarantee.
